(vector (map (:adr/authoritative_for (vector "cloud-itonami-iso3166-{fra,can,aus} :implemented" "cloud-itonami-iso3166-{gtm,hnd,jam,fji,brn,blr} blueprint scope")), (:adr/topic "cloud-itonami-iso3166-wave-fra-can-aus-batch28"), (:adr/status "accepted"), (:adr/id "adr-2607106200-cloud-itonami-iso3166-wave-fra-can-aus-batch28"), (:adr/doc_type "adr"), (:adr/body "# ADR-2607106200: iso3166 wave — FRA/CAN/AUS :implemented, contacts, batch 28\n\n**Status**: accepted\n**Date**: 2026-07-10\n\n## Decision\n\n1. **:implemented** — FRA (eu-establishment / siret), CAN (ca-presence / bn),\n   AUS (au-presence / abn); 24 tests each.\n2. **Contacts** — expand to ~132 entries with institutional `:head-role` for\n   major countries (51 with head-role); organization.edn across blueprints.\n3. **Batch 28** — GTM, HND, JAM, FJI, BRN, BLR → :blueprint.\n\n## Registry\n\n- total 227 · implemented 8 · blueprint 124 · spec 95"), (:adr/deciders (vector "Jun Kawasaki")), (:adr/date "2026-07-10"), (:db/id -1), (:adr/decision-summary "{:implemented [\"FRA\" \"CAN\" \"AUS\"], :batch28 [\"GTM\" \"HND\" \"JAM\" \"FJI\" \"BRN\" \"BLR\"], :contacts 132, :maturity {:implemented 8 :blueprint 124 :spec 95 :total 227}}"), (:adr/title "ADR-2607106200: iso3166 wave — FRA/CAN/AUS :implemented, contacts, batch 28"), (:adr/source-format "edn")))